# Ask one arm's executor to intercept and grasp. The same goal works for every arm.

# Goal
GraspAction grasp
---
# Result
# One of: closed, no_feasible_intercept, tool_cannot_tilt, ik_failed, trajectory_rejected, aborted.
string outcome
string detail
# When and where the tool met the grasp point, world frame.
builtin_interfaces/Time meet_time
geometry_msgs/Point meet_point
---
# Feedback
# One of: planning, approaching, following, closing.
string phase
